## Bundled style fixture

`fixtures/styles/gb-t-7714-2025-numeric.js` is a Banyan preset style authored
by jiaojiaodubai and declared MIT in its `INFO` block. It is bundled from the
plugin preset with a local date-formatting fix (UTC date parts instead of
`Date#toString()`) so the end-to-end snapshot does not depend on the host
timezone. It is test data, not part of the runtime.

